# Lane ownership: AUTHORITATIVE (PLAN.md §3; D-0276: one serial worker owns the workspace).
# path-glob<TAB>owner[,owner]  first match wins; '*' crosses '/'; '#' starts a comment.
# =<token><TAB><bot>: branch bot/<token>[-topic] acts as <bot>. Crossing a migrate-owned
# path needs the owner's agreement and a 'Cross-Lane: <owner>' trailer.
# Consumers (shim-gate, lane-check): skip comment lines and =token alias lines by explicit rule; every other
# non-empty line must have ≥2 tab-separated columns (else fail closed).
# D-0276 supersedes the per-crate one-writer split of D-0198/D-0199. Migrate still owns this file's contents.
